Source: strawwu-components
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: StrawCoding <dev@strawcoding.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: strawwu-bridge
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: StrawWU kernel-userspace IPC bridge
 Provides the bridge daemon (strawwu-bridged) that translates
 between Win32 subsystem calls and Linux syscalls via seccomp policy.

Package: strawwu-runtime
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, strawwu-bridge (= ${binary:Version})
Description: StrawWU runtime orchestrator
 Manages SubsystemSession lifecycle, process graph, app profiles,
 and workload scheduling for native/container/microvm backends.

Package: strawwu-launcher
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, strawwu-runtime (= ${binary:Version})
Description: StrawWU application launcher
 CLI tool (strawwu) for launching PE/ELF binaries in the
 StrawWU runtime environment.
